# The payload's bytes are checksummed in toolkit.manifest.json, and the
# installer refuses anything that does not match. git line-ending normalisation
# would rewrite those bytes in transit and break every checksum, so nothing in
# this repository is treated as text to be converted.
#
# This is not a style preference. Without it the online update path fails on
# every file with "the downloaded files failed verification" — which is what it
# did the first time it was tried for real.
* -text
